[海浪拍打]

00:52.033 --> 00:55.033
[Hawaiian music]
[夏威夷音乐]

00:55.033 --> 01:02.400
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

01:02.400 --> 01:04.567
- I'm ready.
I'm ready.
- 我准备好了。
我准备好了。

01:04.567 --> 01:07.800
Ready to steal the Krabby Patty
secret formula.
准备偷走蟹黄饼
秘密配方。

01:07.800 --> 01:11.467
Prepare to initiate plan
number...hmm...
准备启动计划
数……嗯……

01:11.467 --> 01:13.100
number--what's the number?
号码——号码是多少？

01:13.100 --> 01:14.167
Oh well, who cares?
哦，好吧，谁在乎呢？

01:14.167 --> 01:15.633
- Good question.
- 好问题。

01:15.633 --> 01:16.633
- Say wha?
- 说什么？

01:16.633 --> 01:18.267
- I said, good luck.
- 我说，祝你好运。

01:18.267 --> 01:21.067
- That formula will be mine.
- 那个公式将是我的。

01:21.067 --> 01:22.567
Out of my way, pinheads.
别挡我的路，笨蛋。

01:22.567 --> 01:24.300
Move it.
Move it. Move it.
移动它。
移动它。移动它。

01:24.300 --> 01:26.633
Hey there, Schnozzola.
嘿，施诺佐拉。

01:26.633 --> 01:30.233
I'm about to show you the
advantage of not having a nose.
我要向你展示
优点是没有鼻子。

01:30.233 --> 01:34.300
Say hello to...
Mr. Stinky!
向...问好
臭先生！

01:34.300 --> 01:35.867
[together]
What is that? A kitty cat?
[一起]
那是什么？一只小猫？

01:35.867 --> 01:37.633
Oh, it's so cute.
It's adorable.
哦，真可爱。
很可爱。

01:37.633 --> 01:41.067
- That's right, everyone,
gather in real close.
- 没错，大家，
真正近距离地聚集在一起。

01:41.067 --> 01:43.633
Time to trigger the stench.
是时候触发恶臭了。

01:43.633 --> 01:45.267
Yoink.
哟因克。

01:45.267 --> 01:46.533
[bee buzzing]
[蜜蜂嗡嗡声]

01:46.533 --> 01:47.933
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

01:47.933 --> 01:51.633
[farts]
[放屁]

01:51.633 --> 01:55.067
[together]
Ahh! I'll never breathe again.
[一起]
啊！我再也无法呼吸了

01:55.067 --> 01:57.667
- Ahhhhhhh!
- 啊啊啊啊！

01:57.667 --> 01:59.467
- [gasping]
- [喘气]

01:59.467 --> 02:01.833
- Ahh!
- 啊！

02:01.833 --> 02:03.067
- Huh?
- 啊？

02:03.067 --> 02:04.867
No.
No, no, no, no.
不。
不，不，不，不。

02:04.867 --> 02:07.100
No,
not the patties!
不，
不是肉饼！

02:07.100 --> 02:08.767
I'll save you.
我会救你的。

02:08.767 --> 02:11.067
[sniffs]
[嗅嗅]

02:11.067 --> 02:12.533
[groans]
[呻吟]

02:12.533 --> 02:14.833
- What's all the racket out
here?
- 到底是怎么回事？
在这里？

02:14.833 --> 02:19.100
[sniffing]
[嗅嗅]

02:19.100 --> 02:22.200
[together]
Ahhh!
[一起]
啊啊！

02:22.200 --> 02:25.933
- Get it off!
Get it off of me!
- 把它取下来！
把它从我身上拿开！

02:25.933 --> 02:27.400
- Mr. Krabs,
are you all right?
- 蟹老板先生，
你还好吗？

02:27.400 --> 02:29.067
What happened?
- I don't know.
发生了什么？
- 我不知道。

02:29.067 --> 02:30.533
Me eyes were burning.
我的眼睛在燃烧。

02:30.533 --> 02:32.233
All I saw was a little eyeball
and a pair of antenna
我只看到一个小眼球
和一对天线

02:32.233 --> 02:33.833
and...Plankton!
还有……浮游生物！

02:33.833 --> 02:36.867
He's still in there,
alone, with me secret formula.
他还在里面，
独自一人，和我一起的秘密配方。

02:36.867 --> 02:39.267
He could be doing
anything with it.
他可能正在做
任何与它有关的东西。

02:39.267 --> 02:42.833
He could be reading it.
他可能正在读它。

02:42.833 --> 02:45.200
Gimme yer hand, boy-o.
把你的手给我，男孩。

02:45.200 --> 02:47.367
I need to borrow this.
我需要借这个。

02:47.367 --> 02:50.067
Okay,
I'm going in.
好吧，
我要进去了。

02:50.067 --> 02:52.300
- Good luck, Mr. Krabs.
- 祝你好运，蟹老板。

02:52.300 --> 02:54.067
- Hmm.
- 唔。

02:54.067 --> 02:56.700
Hmm, mm-mm-mm-mm-mm-mm.
嗯，毫米-毫米-毫米-毫米-毫米-毫米。

02:56.700 --> 02:58.433
Mm?
毫米？

02:58.433 --> 02:59.833
Why, you little--
为什么，你这个小——

02:59.833 --> 03:02.400
- I hope you like percussion,
Eugene.
- 我希望你喜欢打击乐，
尤金.

03:02.400 --> 03:05.233
Because these drumsticks really
go bongo.
因为这些鸡腿真的
去邦戈吧。

03:05.233 --> 03:07.833
[laughs]
[笑]

03:07.833 --> 03:13.567
[loud explosion]
[爆炸声]

03:13.567 --> 03:15.467
Ahh.
啊。

03:15.467 --> 03:18.367
What?
The old safe-in-a-safe routine?
什么？
旧的安全套惯例？

03:18.367 --> 03:19.733
- Here's another routine:
- 这是另一个例程：

03:19.733 --> 03:21.633
you're the
meat in me knuckle sandwich.
你是
我的指关节三明治里有肉。

03:21.633 --> 03:24.067
- I'm not hungry.
- 我不饿。

03:24.067 --> 03:26.133
- Bleh.
- 布莱赫。

03:26.133 --> 03:27.500
SpongeBob!
海绵宝宝！

03:27.500 --> 03:33.067
- Yes, sir.
I see the problem.
- 是的，先生。
我看到了问题所在。

03:33.067 --> 03:34.533
- Yeeeooow!
- 耶哦！

03:34.533 --> 03:37.733
[militaristic music]
[军国主义音乐]

03:37.733 --> 03:40.200
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

03:40.200 --> 03:45.133
[together]
Yay! Hooray! Whoo-hoo!
[一起]
耶！万岁！呼呼！

03:45.133 --> 03:47.167
- [farts]
- [放屁]

03:47.167 --> 03:50.433
[together]
Ahh!
[一起]
啊！

03:50.433 --> 03:52.767
- Oooh, that was too close,
m'lad.
- 哦，那太近了，
小伙子。

03:52.767 --> 03:55.233
Three more safes and he would
have had me secret formula.
再多三个保险箱他就会
有我的秘密配方。

03:55.233 --> 03:58.400
Looks like I'm gonna have to
beef up security around here.
看来我得
加强这里的安全。

04:01.133 --> 04:04.633
I'm gonna need you to do me a
big favor, laddie.
我需要你帮我做一个
帮个大忙，小伙子。

04:04.633 --> 04:06.100
Take this home with you and hide
it
把这个带回家藏起来
它

04:06.100 --> 04:09.233
while I reevaluate
my security situation.
当我重新评估时
我的安全状况。

04:09.233 --> 04:10.833
- Whoa-oh, oh, oh, oh.
- 哇哦，哦，哦，哦。

04:10.833 --> 04:13.067
But, Mr. Krabs, how do you know
it will be safe
但是，蟹老板，你怎么知道
会很安全的

04:13.067 --> 04:14.667
from Plankton at my house?
来自我家的浮游生物？

04:14.667 --> 04:16.867
- Pe-shaw, he'll think it's
still here.
- Pe-shaw，他会认为这是
还在这里。

04:16.867 --> 04:20.667
His tiny brain is incapable of
the kind of abstract thinking
他的小脑袋无法
那种抽象思维

04:20.667 --> 04:22.633
that is required for reflection
这是反思所需要的

04:22.633 --> 04:25.067
or thoughtful reasoning and
deduction.
或深思熟虑的推理和
扣除。

04:25.067 --> 04:26.333
He cannot ruminate.
他无法反省。

04:26.333 --> 04:28.267
He cannot divine the
hypothesis.
他无法占卜
假设。

04:28.267 --> 04:30.733
He's a tired clown.
他是一个疲惫的小丑。

04:30.733 --> 04:33.433
He'll never know it's in your
house.
他永远不会知道它在你的里面
房子。

04:33.433 --> 04:36.633
- Oh, you're right, Professor
Krab-Face.
- 哦，你说得对，教授
螃蟹脸。

04:36.633 --> 04:39.867
I'm much too simpleminded to
look there.
我太简单了
看看那里。

04:39.867 --> 04:42.400
[cackling]
[咯咯笑]

04:42.400 --> 04:45.400
[jazzy suspenseful music]
【爵士悬疑音乐】

04:45.400 --> 04:48.233
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

04:48.233 --> 04:51.300
- [whimpering]
- [呜咽]

04:51.300 --> 04:52.433
- Hey, there.
- 嘿。

04:52.433 --> 04:54.133
- Ahh!
- 啊！

04:54.133 --> 04:56.400
- Pleasant night, eh, SpongeBob?
- 愉快的夜晚，嗯，海绵宝宝？

04:56.400 --> 04:58.200
- Oh, uh...yes.
- 哦，呃...是的。

04:58.200 --> 05:01.400
It's a very...nighty...night for
a walkie.
这是一个非常...夜晚...的夜晚
步话机。

05:01.400 --> 05:02.767
- Ain't that the truth.
- 这不是事实吗？

05:02.767 --> 05:04.667
Hey, nothing
gets past you.
嘿，没什么
超越你。

05:04.667 --> 05:08.367
One could say you
have the "formula" for honesty.
有人可以说你
有诚实的“公式”。

05:08.367 --> 05:10.700
- Uh, yeah, one could say that,
I guess.
- 呃，是的，有人可以这么说，
我猜。

05:10.700 --> 05:13.367
Anyway, I gotta go wash
my formula--hair!
无论如何，我得去洗漱了
我的公式——头发！

05:13.367 --> 05:14.833
Hair!
I gotta go wash my hair!
头发！
我得去洗头了！

05:14.833 --> 05:16.433
Uh...good night, Plankton.
呃……晚安，浮游生物。

05:16.433 --> 05:21.600
- Yeah, gotta keep that hair
clean...and in a safe place.
- 是的，必须保留那头发
干净……并且在安全的地方。

05:21.600 --> 05:23.667
- Uh, okay, bye.
- 呃，好吧，再见。

05:25.300 --> 05:26.800
- Now, remember, Gary.
- 现在，记住，加里。

05:26.800 --> 05:28.800
I'm entrusting
you with the secret formula.
我委托
你用秘密公式。

05:28.800 --> 05:30.533
- Meow.
- Stay sharp, Gary.
- 喵。
- 保持敏锐，加里。

05:30.533 --> 05:31.767
Don't let anyone inside.
不要让任何人进来。

05:31.767 --> 05:34.100
- Meow.
- Bye, Gary.
- 喵。
- 再见，加里。

05:34.100 --> 05:36.200
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

05:36.200 --> 05:38.967
- [cackling]
- [咯咯笑]

05:38.967 --> 05:41.867
[knock at door]
[敲门]

05:41.867 --> 05:43.933
- Why, hey, there, little fella.
- 为什么，嘿，那里，小家伙。

05:43.933 --> 05:47.667
Is SpongeBob--I mean--
your master at home?
海绵宝宝是——我是说——
你家主人？

05:47.667 --> 05:49.833
Uh, perhaps I could just come
inside for a minute
呃，也许我可以来
里面一分钟

05:49.833 --> 05:52.567
and demonstrate our fine snail
products:
并展示我们的精美蜗牛
产品：

05:52.567 --> 05:56.367
shell polish, slime deodorant,
chew toys,
贝壳抛光剂、粘液除臭剂、
咀嚼玩具，

05:56.367 --> 05:58.667
My leg!
我的腿！

05:58.667 --> 06:00.300
Your friends won't tell you
this,
你的朋友不会告诉你
这个，

06:00.300 --> 06:04.200
but you can really use the slime
deodorant, smelly.
但你真的可以使用史莱姆
除臭剂，臭。

06:06.067 --> 06:09.467
[doorbell rings]
[门铃响]

06:09.467 --> 06:11.067
- Hello, s...
[clears throat]
- 你好，是...
[清嗓子]

06:11.067 --> 06:12.333
Hello, sir.
你好先生。

06:12.333 --> 06:14.067
I'm selling Sweetie
Patrol cookies.
我要卖甜甜
巡逻饼干。

06:14.067 --> 06:18.733
We have a lovely assortment of
fungi and algae flavors.
我们有各种各样的可爱的
真菌和藻类的味道。

06:18.733 --> 06:21.233
How many delicious boxes can
I put you down for?
能吃多少盒好吃的
我贬低你是为了什么？

06:21.233 --> 06:23.533
If you order
ten boxes, I'll qualify for my
如果您订购
十盒，我就有资格获得我的

06:23.533 --> 06:25.100
Bottom Dweller Badge.
底层居民徽章。

06:25.100 --> 06:28.167
If you order 100 boxes,
I'll get my Bling Bling Badge.
如果您订购 100 盒，
我会得到我的 Bling Bling 徽章。

06:28.167 --> 06:30.300
You know, you should
hide these from your roommate.
你知道，你应该
对你的室友隐藏这些。

06:30.300 --> 06:32.067
She'll eat all of them.
她会把它们全部吃掉。

06:32.067 --> 06:36.300
If you show me your best hiding
place, I'd be happy to help.
如果你向我展示你最好的隐藏
的地方，我很乐意提供帮助。

06:36.300 --> 06:37.633
- Meow, meow!
- 喵，喵！

06:37.633 --> 06:39.233
- [growls]
- [咆哮]

06:39.233 --> 06:40.633
[loud explosion]
[爆炸声]

06:40.633 --> 06:44.067
Ehhh, note to self:
呃，自我提醒：

06:44.067 --> 06:47.200
nitroglycerine is not a
substitute
硝化甘油不是
替代品

06:47.200 --> 06:51.633
for vanilla extract.
用于香草精。

06:53.433 --> 06:55.800
- [growling]
- [咆哮]

06:55.800 --> 06:57.700
Meow?
喵？

06:58.967 --> 07:03.300
[growling]
[咆哮]

07:03.300 --> 07:06.833
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

07:06.833 --> 07:10.100
I forgot how much I
hate pineapple.
我忘记了我是多少
讨厌菠萝。

07:10.100 --> 07:13.633
- [mumbling]
- [咕哝]

07:17.333 --> 07:18.433
- Ehh.
- 呃。

07:18.433 --> 07:21.100
- [mumbling]
- [咕哝]

07:21.100 --> 07:22.567
- [munching]
- [咀嚼]

07:22.567 --> 07:26.067
Hey, this snail litter tastes
better than pineapple.
嘿，这蜗牛窝有味道
比菠萝好。

07:26.067 --> 07:30.500
Now, where is
that secret formula?
现在，在哪里
那个秘密配方？

07:30.500 --> 07:32.167
Where is it?
Where is it?
它在哪里？
它在哪里？

07:32.167 --> 07:33.500
Gotta be
here somewhere.
一定是
这里某处。

07:33.500 --> 07:34.833
[grunts]
[咕哝]

07:34.833 --> 07:37.133
Nothin' in there.
Ooh, look at that.
里面什么也没有。
哦，看看那个。

07:37.133 --> 07:38.433
Mm-hmm.
嗯嗯。

07:38.433 --> 07:40.267
[grunts]
[咕哝]

07:40.267 --> 07:41.500
[grunts]
[咕哝]

07:41.500 --> 07:43.333
Hello.
[echoing]
你好。
[回声]

07:43.333 --> 07:45.800
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

07:45.800 --> 07:49.500
Where the barnacles is it?
藤壶在哪里？

07:49.500 --> 07:50.633
Gah!
嘎！

07:50.633 --> 07:52.500
Where is it?
Where is it?
它在哪里？
它在哪里？

07:52.500 --> 07:54.067
I know you're in here.
我知道你在这儿。

07:54.067 --> 07:55.833
You're not fooling anybody.
你没有欺骗任何人。

07:55.833 --> 07:58.967
I went to college.
我上大学了。

08:05.200 --> 08:10.200
Nope. Nope. Nope.
没有。没有。没有。

08:10.200 --> 08:11.433
[dropper whistles]
[滴管哨声]

08:11.433 --> 08:12.633
Hmm.
唔。

08:12.633 --> 08:13.733
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

08:13.733 --> 08:16.767
[loud thump]
[重击声]

08:22.467 --> 08:23.500
- Whew.
- 呼。

08:23.500 --> 08:25.533
[cackles]
[咯咯笑]

08:25.533 --> 08:27.067
- [growls]
- [咆哮]

08:27.067 --> 08:28.200
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

08:28.200 --> 08:31.133
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

08:31.133 --> 08:33.133
- Meow?
- 喵？

08:33.133 --> 08:35.267
Ohh-ohh.
哦哦。

08:35.267 --> 08:39.133
- Ehh? Mm-hmm. Uh-huh.
- 呃？嗯嗯。嗯嗯。

08:39.133 --> 08:40.567
Wah! Wah!
哇！哇！

08:40.567 --> 08:42.333
Ahh!
啊！

08:42.333 --> 08:45.800
Augh! Oof! Ahh-ahh-ahh-ahh!
Ugh! Ahh-ahh-ahh!
啊啊！钱币！啊啊啊啊啊啊！
啊!啊啊啊啊！

08:45.800 --> 08:47.067
- [snickers]
- [窃笑]

08:47.067 --> 08:48.200
- Ahh!
- 啊！

08:48.200 --> 08:49.700
Ooh!
哦！

08:49.700 --> 08:51.433
Ahh! Augh!
啊！啊啊！

08:51.433 --> 08:54.167
Eh, eh, eh...augh!
诶诶诶……哎呀！

08:54.167 --> 08:56.300
Ehh, ehh, ehh, augh!
呃呃呃呃！

08:56.300 --> 08:58.633
[vacuum whirring]
[真空呼呼]

08:58.633 --> 09:02.400
- Ooh.
[grunting]
- 哦。
[咕噜声]

09:04.700 --> 09:07.100
All right, snail,
let's go.
好吧，蜗牛，
我们走吧。

09:07.100 --> 09:08.200
Just you and me.
只有你和我。

09:08.200 --> 09:09.233
- [growls]
- [咆哮]

09:09.233 --> 09:11.200
- Put 'em up.
Put 'em up.
- 把它们放起来。
把它们放起来。

09:11.200 --> 09:14.067
Ooh! Oh! Ooh! Oh! Ahh!
哦！哦！哦！哦！啊！

09:14.067 --> 09:16.067
- Meow!
- 喵！

09:16.067 --> 09:17.167
- Huh?
- 啊？

09:17.167 --> 09:18.700
Of course.
当然。

09:18.700 --> 09:21.800
What a fool I've been.
我真是个傻瓜。

09:21.800 --> 09:27.300
- SpongeBob's hidden the secret
formula inside Gary's shell.
- 海绵宝宝隐藏了秘密
加里壳内的公式。

09:27.300 --> 09:32.267
Sheesh, this place is
disgusting.
谢什，这个地方是
恶心的。

09:32.267 --> 09:33.667
I bet it reeks.
我打赌它一定很臭。

09:33.667 --> 09:35.433
Good thing I don't
have a nose.
还好我不
有鼻子。

09:35.433 --> 09:36.500
Ay-yi-yi.
艾依依。

09:36.500 --> 09:38.067
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

09:38.067 --> 09:42.433
Ahh, ahh, ahh, ahh, ahh, ahh!
啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！

09:42.433 --> 09:46.633
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

09:46.633 --> 09:50.900
Ahh!
啊！

09:50.900 --> 09:53.733
- Gary, I'm home.
- 加里，我回来了。

09:53.733 --> 09:54.733
[gasps]
[喘气]

09:54.733 --> 09:56.467
What happened here?
这里发生了什么？

09:56.467 --> 09:58.800
Oh, my first Krabby
Patty.
哦，我的第一个蟹蟹
帕蒂。

09:58.800 --> 10:00.300
I had it bronzed.
我把它晒成了古铜色。

10:00.300 --> 10:02.833
Oh, and I was gonna give that
to my grandchildren.
哦，我本来打算给的
给我的孙子们。

10:02.833 --> 10:05.767
Ahh, my Mermaid Man collectable
underpants.
啊啊，我的美人鱼男人收藏品
内裤。

10:05.767 --> 10:08.500
Oh, I could have worn them
1,000 more times.
哦，我本来可以穿它们
再重复1000次。

10:08.500 --> 10:11.300
[gasps]
My glass of water.
[喘气]
我的一杯水。

10:11.300 --> 10:13.033
I was gonna drink that.
我正想喝那个。

10:13.033 --> 10:15.833
Oh,
the Krabby Patty formula.
哦，
蟹黄饼配方。

10:15.833 --> 10:18.700
Oh, it's safe,
and right where I left it.
哦，安全了，
就在我离开的地方。

10:18.700 --> 10:21.333
- [growling]
- [咆哮]

10:21.333 --> 10:24.100
- Gary, did you do this?
- 加里，这是你做的吗？

10:24.100 --> 10:25.633
What's the matter, Gary?
怎么了，加里？

10:25.633 --> 10:26.967
Something wrong with your shell?
- Meow.
你的外壳有问题吗？
- 喵。

10:26.967 --> 10:28.533
- Something's not right, Gary.
- 有点不对劲，加里。

10:28.533 --> 10:30.033
I better get you to the vet.
我最好带你去看兽医。

10:30.033 --> 10:31.300
- Meow.
- 喵。

10:31.300 --> 10:34.333
- [panting]
- [气喘吁吁]

10:34.333 --> 10:36.967
Whoa-oh, ehh-ehh.
哇哦，呃呃。

10:36.967 --> 10:38.933
Ha,
I lost him.
哈，
我失去了他。

10:38.933 --> 10:40.767
And now I'm lost.
现在我迷路了。

10:40.767 --> 10:45.633
Ahhhhhhhh!
啊啊啊啊！

10:45.633 --> 10:48.033
Ehh...my head.
呃……我的头。

10:48.033 --> 10:52.000
Ooh, I must be in the
center of the shell.
哦，我一定是在
壳的中心。

10:52.000 --> 10:54.367
What's that?
This is it.
那是什么？
就是这样。

10:54.367 --> 10:56.000
Just like I thought.
就像我想的那样。

10:56.000 --> 10:58.300
It was hidden here all the time.
它一直隐藏在这里。

10:58.300 --> 11:00.767
The
secret Krabby Patty formula.
的
秘制蟹黄派配方。

11:00.767 --> 11:03.667
It's beautiful.
很美丽。

11:03.667 --> 11:05.300
The heavenly light.
天上的光。

11:05.300 --> 11:08.900
I always knew I'd see it once
I'd gotten the formula.
我一直都知道我会看到它一次
我已经得到了公式。

11:08.900 --> 11:12.800
Let me bask in it's glory.
让我沐浴在它的荣耀之中吧。

11:12.800 --> 11:14.867
- Well, that's odd.
Who's that?
- 嗯，这很奇怪。
那是谁？

11:14.867 --> 11:16.100
- Hey, it's Plankton.
- 嘿，这是浮游生物。

11:16.100 --> 11:17.767
- What's he got there?
- 他那里有什么？

11:17.767 --> 11:19.767
- Looks like one of my old
grocery lists.
- 看起来像我的旧人之一
杂货清单。

11:19.767 --> 11:21.633
- I don't know how he got in
there,
- 我不知道他是怎么进来的
在那里，

11:21.633 --> 11:23.233
but the gasses inside this shell
但是这个壳里面的气体

11:23.233 --> 11:25.300
are making the little guy
hallucinate.
正在制作小家伙
产生幻觉。

11:25.300 --> 11:28.233
He would have smelled the gasses
if he had a nose,
他会闻到气体的味道
如果他有鼻子的话

11:28.233 --> 11:31.167
like most good-hearted people
像大多数好心人一样

11:31.167 --> 11:32.733
[sniffs]
[嗅嗅]

11:32.733 --> 11:35.300
- Ha-ha.
I got it!
- 哈哈。
我得到了它！

11:35.300 --> 11:37.067
I got it!
我得到了它！

11:37.067 --> 11:39.167
I finally got the formula!
我终于得到公式了！

11:39.167 --> 11:41.433
It's mine! It's mine! It's mine!
It's mine!
这是我的！这是我的！这是我的！
这是我的！

11:41.433 --> 11:44.167
Open the sparkling apple
juice, Karen!
打开闪闪发光的苹果
果汁，凯伦！

11:44.167 --> 11:46.833
Daddy's bringing the
bacon home!
爸爸带来了
培根回家！

11:46.833 --> 11:48.300
Whoo-hoo-hoo-hoo!
Wow!
呼呼呼呼！
哇！

呼呼呼呼！
哇！